==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|cu|ru}} {{term|людиє|sc=Cyrs|lang=cu}} < {{proto|Slavic|ljudъ|lang=ru}} < {{proto|Indo-European|h₁lewdʰ-o-|men, people|lang=ru}}. Compare English ''[[lede#Etymology 2|lede]]'', Old Norse {{term|lýðr|lýðir|people}} ( > Icelandic {{term|lýður}}), Gothic {{term|𐌻𐌹𐌿𐌸𐍃|sc=Goth|tr=liuþs}}, German {{term|Leute|lang=de}}.

